<p>The Toolset's <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Options" title="Options (page does not exist)">Options</a> window is opened by selecting <b>Tools &gt; Options</b> from the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Toolset%20menu%20bar" title="Toolset menu bar (page does not exist)">Toolset menu bar</a>. 
